**The thesis:** the loudest stream on the internet is produced by a man built entirely for quiet. He screams at video games because a game is the one opponent that can't be hurt and can't leave — off-stream he couldn't even quit his own job (he told chat "get me to 5,000 subs and I'll call in," then had his dad make the call). The aha beat: his mom used to lie on his bed watching him play Call of Duty every night; streaming recreates that exact arrangement at a 298,512-person scale.

